      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mmkay... Guess you’ve got stuff to do, huh...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006D006B00610079002E002E002E00200047007500650073007300200079006F007520190076006500200067006F007400200073007400750066006600200074006F00200064006F002C0020006800750068002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What? But the rain might stop!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F002000420075007400200074006800650020007200610069006E0020006D0069006700680074002000730074006F0070002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What? You want to battle me that bad? Sure then,\nlet’s wait together...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rain! It’s finally here!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200610069006E002100200049007420190073002000660069006E0061006C006C007900200068006500720065002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now my team’s moves are all powered up! Water\ntypes and rain are the best combo—you’ll see!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow, I couldn’t win even though the rain gave my\nWater-type team an advantage.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet you noticed all my Pokémon know Water-\ntype moves, right?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000620065007400200079006F00750020006E006F0074006900630065006400200061006C006C0020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006B006E006F0077002000570061007400650072002D000A00740079007000650020006D006F007600650073002C002000720069006700680074003F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, Water-type moves become more powerful in\nthe rain! That’s why I thought I could win...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know what else, though?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F00770020007700680061007400200065006C00730065002C002000740068006F007500670068003F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fire-type moves become weaker in the rain.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006900720065002D00740079007000650020006D006F0076006500730020006200650063006F006D00650020007700650061006B0065007200200069006E00200074006800650020007200610069006E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It makes sense, really. Rain makes things wet,\nand wet things are tough to burn!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
